  "question": {
    "text": "What weight of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><mtext>2</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> (molecular weight = 126 g/mol) should be dissolved to prepare 250 ml of centinormal solution to be used as reducing agent?"
